---
import FarmLayout from '../../layouts/FarmLayout.astro';

// How It Works — Modern Direct Farm Logistics Guide
---

<FarmLayout
  title="How Pre-Order Farm Delivery Works | Farm Direct"
  description="Learn about our consolidated agricultural transport model bringing raw seasonal produce directly from village farms to Gwalior, Karera, and Shivpuri."
  canonicalPath="/farm/how-it-works"
>
  <div class="fd-container py-8 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      <!-- Title & Header -->
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800 font-extrabold bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full">
          <span>🚜</span>
          <span>Field-to-Home Supply Chain</span>
        </span>
        <h1 class="fd-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#122815] leading-tight">
          How Farm Direct Works
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#5b6e5d] leading-relaxed">
          Why we operate on a planned pre-order and consolidated neighbourhood delivery model instead of instant warehouse delivery.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Modern Comparison Card: Traditional Supermarket vs Farm Direct -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-[#e2ece0] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm overflow-hidden space-y-6">
        <h2 class="fd-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#122815] text-center">
          The Two Different Ways to Buy Food Grains
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-2">
          <!-- Traditional Way -->
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#faf5f5] border border-red-100 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-red-700 font-extrabold text-sm">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">✕</span>
              <span>Traditional Supermarket & Quick Commerce</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[#6e4444] leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">•</span>
                <span><strong>Heavy chemical coatings:</strong> Polished with talc, oil, or preservatives to sit on store shelves for 6–12 months.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">•</span>
                <span><strong>4–5 Middlemen:</strong> Village commission agents, district mandis, wholesalers, and retail markups add 40%–60% costs.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-red-400 font-bold">•</span>
                <span><strong>No origin trace:</strong> Mixed batches from multiple undisclosed sources.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Farm Direct Way -->
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f2f7f1] border border-emerald-200/80 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-800 font-extrabold text-sm">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xs">✓</span>
              <span>Farm Direct (Our Model)</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[#2e5232] leading-relaxed">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">•</span>
                <span><strong>100% Raw & Sun-Dried:</strong> Harvested, threshed, winnowed, and sun-dried naturally. Zero synthetic polishing.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">•</span>
                <span><strong>Zero Middlemen:</strong> Grains travel directly from village farm silos into our transport vehicle to your doorstep.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">•</span>
                <span><strong>Inspect Before Payment:</strong> Smell the freshness and check grains with zero risk before paying via UPI/Cash.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">•</span>
                <span><strong>100% Traceable Farm:</strong> Cultivated on fertile village farmland serving Gwalior & Shivpuri Districts (<a href="https://share.google/WybqH9qjZj9aiYcoz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 underline font-bold text-emerald-900 hover:text-black"><img src="/farm/images/google-maps-icon.svg" alt="Google Maps" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 object-contain inline-block shrink-0" />view farm on Google Maps ↗</a>).</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4-Step Interactive Timeline -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto">
          <h3 class="fd-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#122815]">
            Our 4-Step Sunday Delivery Cycle
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#5b6e5d] mt-1">
            Weekly rhythm ensuring peak freshness across Gwalior, Karera, and Shivpuri
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <!-- Step 1 -->
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2ece0] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#edf4ec] text-[#1b4522] font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                01
              </div>
              <h4 class="fd-display font-extrabold text-base text-[#122815]">Pre-Order Online</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#526454] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Place your order Monday through Friday. Pick your bag sizes (1kg, 5kg, 10kg, 25kg) with live authoritative prices. No payment upfront.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-emerald-800 tracking-wider">Mon – Fri Window</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 2 -->
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2ece0] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#edf4ec] text-[#1b4522] font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                02
              </div>
              <h4 class="fd-display font-extrabold text-base text-[#122815]">Farm Packing</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#526454] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                On Saturday, our farm team measures and bags grains into eco-friendly bags directly from our village storage bins near Gwalior.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-emerald-800 tracking-wider">Saturday Preparation</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 3 -->
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2ece0] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#edf4ec] text-[#1b4522] font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                03
              </div>
              <h4 class="fd-display font-extrabold text-base text-[#122815]">Scheduled Farm Dispatch</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#526454] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Our farm utility vehicle leaves the village and arrives in Sirsod, Karera, Shivpuri, Pawan Nagar & Chetakpuri for planned doorstep drops.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-emerald-800 tracking-wider">Sunday Morning</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 4 -->
          <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-[#e2ece0] shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
            <div>
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#edf4ec] text-[#1b4522] font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                04
              </div>
              <h4 class="fd-display font-extrabold text-base text-[#122815]">Inspect & Pay</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#526454] mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Check the grains, feel the quality, and pay our delivery driver via UPI QR code or cash at your door.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-emerald-800 tracking-wider">Zero Upfront Risk</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Section -->
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-[#e2ece0] p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <h3 class="fd-display text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#122815] text-center">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h3>

        <div class="space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f8faf7] border border-[#e8f0e6] space-y-1">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#152317] block">Can I test quality before ordering 10kg or 25kg bags?</strong>
            <p class="text-[#526454] leading-relaxed">
              Yes! We provide free 100g or 200g tasting pouches with zero product charges. Simply submit a sample request for your neighbourhood round.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f8faf7] border border-[#e8f0e6] space-y-1">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#152317] block">What if I live outside currently listed clusters?</strong>
            <p class="text-[#526454] leading-relaxed">
              We add new delivery clusters whenever households in a colony or village request grouped delivery. Message us on WhatsApp to set up a route.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#f8faf7] border border-[#e8f0e6] space-y-1">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#152317] block">How is pricing so affordable compared to retail stores?</strong>
            <p class="text-[#526454] leading-relaxed">
              Retail stores pay warehouse holding rents, distributor commissions, packaging design royalties, and retail shelf fees. We eliminate all of that by transporting directly from the village harvest.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Action Footer -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#122815] to-[#1e4624] text-white p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-emerald-900/50 text-center space-y-4">
        <h3 class="fd-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">
          Taste Real Farm Produce This Sunday
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-emerald-100/80 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Order for this week's scheduled dispatch in your cluster, or request a free 100g tasting sample.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 pt-3">
          <a href="/farm/products" class="fd-btn bg-white hover:bg-emerald-50 text-[#122815] font-extrabold text-xs px-6 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-md">
            View This Week's Harvest &rarr;
          </a>
          <a href="/farm/samples" class="fd-btn bg-[#c48a3f] hover:bg-[#b07830] text-white font-extrabold text-xs px-6 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-md">
            Request Free Sample (100g/200g)
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</FarmLayout>
